{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Remove a superseded snapshot when rejecting its replacement.** If a RUNNING snapshot for this ARN is pending while the exporter is blocked and its terminal replacement exceeds the byte budget, this return leaves the RUNNING entry queued. Once unblocked, the lane exports and flushes that stale record, making a completed execution appear active. Before returning, remove any pending entry and token for the same ARN while preserving unrelated backlog; add an oversized-terminal regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s5ySP","finding_digest":"0d1b702cc57e4aae5e848f81d654e8af5ea6f133931fccb3badce74e1b4ca5a5","finding_id":"arf_v1_bunxalgfpzfk4xuer6a5mvhiv5","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane.schedule::oversized-update-retains-stale-snapshot","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane.schedule::oversized-update-retains-stale-snapshot","line":165,"observation_digest":"ffb4539293df96fb808123d99975462c34f0828777f2cc98aff002cdce964b2b","observation_id":"aro_v1_762fheut36lpxaebepmzs5kgfq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-10T01:09:22Z","review_id":"arr_v1_i3ozm3eu24iwkbd6n5o6uqm433","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"cab5f526407f2b3ae911a66b66ba708a0c919dfb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":156,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_f3ulmq2r4fintbxzsg2ywdfa62","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T01:09:22Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
